<title>DUBAI: GOLF-GREEN WINS DESERT CLASSIC PLAYOFF.</title>
<headline>GOLF-GREEN WINS DESERT CLASSIC PLAYOFF.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Richard Green holed a 15-foot birdie putt to win the Dubai Desert Classic on the first hole of a sudden death playoff against Greg Norman and Ian Woosnam on Sunday.</p>
</text>
